    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Closed vial wastage rates - last 12 months\" for Trainingland, November 2015 to October 2016, with wastage rate (%) for nine vaccines (BCG, DPT-HepB-Hib, IPV, MR, OPV, PCV, RV, TT and yellow fever). IPV (red) is highest in almost every month, between about 2 and 3.2%, peaking at 3.2 in April 2016; the other vaccines overlap between about 1 and 2%.",
